        "abstract": "In this letter we investigate the effect of reflector tilt on the characteristics of an offset fed parabolic reflector antenna using a commercially available simulation tool. A satellite bus-mounted reflector with a diameter of 4 m and a laterally offset feed array is considered. Due to the passive nature of the reflector antenna, additional design freedom must be introduced and investigated to further improve the antenna characteristics. In particular, the use of reflector tilt can maintain the boresight of the antenna and also improve its directivity and 3dB beamwidth when the feed horn is laterally displaced.",
